<%--
Rs_Poller - a child whose on_load() always produces the SAME data.

Every refresh() therefore takes the "data unchanged" path: no re-render, no
on_ready(). That is the path where the component used to be left permanently
not ready (audit bug 5).

GLOBALS:
    window.__rs_poller_load_calls   - on_load() call count
    window.__rs_poller_ready_calls  - on_ready() call count
    window.__rs_poller_delay        - ms on_load() sleeps (used to stop a child mid-load)
--%>
<Define:Rs_Poller class="rs-poller">
  <span class="label"><%= this.data.label %></span>
</Define:Rs_Poller>
